<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sc-grid">
      <div class="sc-left">
        <h2>Every list is built to be skimmed</h2>
        <p class="sub">Clear winners, honest trade-offs, real pricing, and a visible review date &mdash; so people (and AI) get a straight answer fast.</p>
        <div class="pts">
          <div class="pt">
            <span class="g"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4"/></svg></span>
            <span class="x"><b>A clear #1, not a maze</b><span>We name the best pick for each kind of buyer.</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pt">
            <span class="g"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.5" y2="16.5"/></svg></span>
            <span class="x"><b>Always dated</b><span>Every list shows when we last checked it.</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pt">
            <span class="g"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="8" x2="14" y2="12"/><line x1="7" y1="16" x2="14" y2="12"/><line x1="14" y1="12" x2="18" y2="6"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="1.6" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
            <span class="x"><b>Structured for machines</b><span>Clean tables &amp; markup AI can read and cite.</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-right">
        <div class="browser">
          <div class="bar">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
            <span class="url">topbesticles.com/best-real-estate-crm</span>
          </div>
          <div class="screen">
            <div class="cat">Real estate tech</div>
            <h3>Best Real Estate CRM Software (2026)</h3>
            <span class="fresh"><span class="d"></span>Updated May 2026</span>
            <div class="table-scroll">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th>#</th><th>Tool</th><th>Best for</th><th>Price</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="top"><td class="rk"><span>1</span></td><td class="nm">Apex CRM <span class="toptag">Top pick</span></td><td class="bf">Teams &amp; speed-to-lead</td><td class="pr">$69/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="rk"><span>2</span></td><td class="nm">Northstar</td><td class="bf">All-in-one + IDX site</td><td class="pr">$499/mo</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="rk"><span>3</span></td><td class="nm">Brightline</td><td class="bf">AI-driven automation</td><td class="pr">Custom</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="rk"><span>4</span></td><td class="nm">Harbor</td><td class="bf">Budget solo agents</td><td class="pr">$39/mo</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.sc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:54px;align-items:center;}
/* Grid items default to min-width:auto, which refuses to shrink below the
   table's min-width and drags the whole card past the viewport on mobile.
   min-width:0 lets .sc-right shrink to the actual track width so the table's
   overflow is contained by .table-scroll instead of blowing out the page. */
.sc-right{min-width:0;}
.sc-left h2{font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.5rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.12;}
.sc-left p.sub{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:1.06rem;margin-top:14px;max-width:430px;}
.pts{margin-top:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.pt{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:flex-start;}
.pt .g{flex:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--grad);display:grid;place-items:center;}
.pt .x b{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;}
.pt .x span{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);}
.browser{border-radius:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--sh-h);overflow:hidden;}
.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 16px;background:#FAFAFE;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
.bar .dot{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#DDE0EE;}
.url{margin-left:12px;flex:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-3);}
.screen{padding:26px 28px 30px;}
.screen .cat{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;}
.screen h3{font-weight:700;font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:6px 0 12px;}
/* Horizontal-scroll mechanics (overflow-x, min-width) live in the shared
   .table-scroll rule in Base.astro's global stylesheet; this component only
   adds its own spacing/typography on top of that. */
.table-scroll{margin-top:18px;}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14.5px;}
thead th{text-align:left;font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600;padding:0 12px 10px;}
tbody td{padding:14px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
.rk span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--bg-2);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);}
tr.top td{background:var(--soft);}
tr.top .rk span{background:var(--grad);color:#fff;}
.nm{font-weight:600;}
.toptag{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:999px;padding:1px 8px;margin-left:8px;}
.bf{color:var(--ink-2);}
.pr{font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
</style>
